      "solution": "Gọi <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là biến cố “Thư đó là thư rác” và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là biến cố “Thư đó bị chặn”.<br>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>01</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0545</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0545</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>9455</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<ol class=\"\"><li>Xác suất thư bị chặn là thư rác: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>045</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>0545</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>90</mn><mn>109</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Xác suất thư không bị chặn là thư đúng: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>9405</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>9455</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1881</mn><mn>1891</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Tỉ lệ thư đúng trong số thư bị chặn là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mi>A</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>19</mn><mn>109</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>17</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>43</mn><mi>%</mi></mrow></semantics></math>; tỉ lệ thư rác trong số thư không bị chặn là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mover><mi>B</mi><mo accent=\"true\">¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displayst